WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:12.174
Hooray! We have finally arrived.

2
00:00:12.175 --> 00:00:14.066
Mom: Let's line up.

3
00:00:14.067 --> 00:00:16.164
Bada: What now, Mom?

4
00:00:16.165 --> 00:00:19.027
Mom: We show our passports to the man.

5
00:00:19.028 --> 00:00:23.773
Mom: He will ask some questions. That's all.

6
00:00:23.774 --> 00:00:27.030
Immigration: Good afternoon! Your passports, please.

7
00:00:27.031 --> 00:00:28.557
Where are you from?

8
00:00:28.558 --> 00:00:33.227
Hana: We are from Korea!

9
00:00:33.228 --> 00:00:35.373
Immigration: How long do you plan to stay?

10
00:00:35.374 --> 00:00:37.878
Mom: We will stay for a month.

11
00:00:37.879 --> 00:00:42.675
Hana: My Aunt Sunny is getting married!

12
00:00:42.676 --> 00:00:44.699
Immigration: How wonderful!

13
00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:47.059
Welcome to the United States.

14
00:00:47.060 --> 00:00:49.234
Immigration: Enjoy your stay here.

15
00:00:49.235 --> 00:00:51.059
Mom: Thank you.

16
00:00:51.060 --> 00:00:53.081
Bada: THANK YOU!

17
00:00:53.082 --> 00:00:58.510
Mom: Now, we have to pick up our bags.

18
00:00:58.511 --> 00:01:01.177
Mom: Hmm. Excuse me, sir.

19
00:01:01.178 --> 00:01:04.110
Where is the baggage claim area?

20
00:01:04.111 --> 00:01:07.196
Officer: Go straight ahead and turn right.

21
00:01:07.197 --> 00:01:08.980
Mom: Thank you.

22
00:01:08.981 --> 00:01:13.320
Officer: My pleasure, ma'am.

23
00:01:13.321 --> 00:01:19.779
I can't wait to go out and see the city!
